<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77830" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά-βυστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stuffed</i> or <i>forced
				in</i>, of a self-invited guest, <i><span class="en">
				Tim.Com.
				1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				6.257a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ παραβύστου καθῆσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.617f
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. κλίνη</span> a <i>small</i>
			or <i>supplementary</i> couch, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>pushed aside</i> or <i>into a corner</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ π.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικαστήριον</span>), an Athenian law-court <i>lying in an
				obscure part of the town</i> (where <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ
				ἕνδεκα</span> held their sittings, <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Timocl.
				26
			</span></i>, 
			<i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				1.28.8
			</span></i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				322
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν παραβύστῳ</span> in <i>a hole and
			corner</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.47
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Top.</u>
				157a4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Nec.</u>
				17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Zos.Alch.
				p.242
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i></div>
